# Local values for `astro dev` and `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored).
#
# The sitemap reads the CMS, so these two are needed for `/sitemap.xml`. Without them the route
# answers 404 rather than an empty sitemap, which would tell a crawler the site has no pages.
#   CMS_URL=https://mc-cms.labcat.workers.dev
#   SITE_KEY=sk_…                  the vwok tenant's site key (a secret, never public)
#
# robots.txt lets AI crawlers read the site by default, which is vwok's legacy behaviour. Set
# this to `false` to turn them away until the per-tenant setting (PJ-104) takes over:
#   AI_CRAWLERS_ALLOWED=true
#
# The form islands (PJ-45, PJ-47) will need the public Turnstile site key, whose documented
# test value always passes:
#   PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=1x00000000000000000000AA
